            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This has nothing to do with 'nvim-treesitter'. Custom textobjects need to be defined [inside `config.custom_textobject`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4035ef97407a6661ae9ff913ff980e271a658502/doc/mini-ai.txt#L754-L765), not as a top-level values. Moving all `f`, `o`, `c` definitions inside `custom_textobjects` table makes it work.",
